{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00861","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高 · 郑世翼","name":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫山凌太清，迢嶢类削成。\n霏霏暮雨合，霭霭朝云生。\n危峰入鸟道，深谷泻猿声。\n别有幽栖客，淹留攀桂情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑世翼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00861.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00861","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}